        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I used the current assessment **RSK-EPGGL-2025Q3-CUR**, dated **September 30, 2025**, for *Epic Games, Inc. v. Google LLC et al.* I did not rely on the older assessment under a historical case-name variant.\n\nApplying **both conditions together**—partial evidence support and active remediation—the qualifying control set is:\n\n| Control ID | Restriction code | Testing state | Evidence reference |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CTL-EPGGL-PI-007 | COMPLIANCE-EVIDENCE-RETENTION | Exception open | EVD-EPGGL-PI-2025-0070 |\n\nThe shared implementation deadline is **November 1, 2024**, which was **333 calendar days past due** as of September 30, 2025.\n\nThe report was submitted, but its receipt is marked **needs_evidence**. The supporting-record resources were restricted to the records-custodian role, so I did not access them.",
